  "description": "This application seeks planning permission for a revised residential scheme at No. 239 High Street, based on the extant planning permission ref. 241202FUL, granted on 20 May 2024.\nThe proposal retains all aspects of the previously approved development at No 237 and 239, including the mansard roof form, scale, massing, and external appearance, but omits the previously approved first-floor extension at No. 239.\nThe proposal also involves the change of use of the approved office accommodation (Use Class E(g)(i)) on the mansard roof, together with the existing office space on the first floor, to two residential flats (Use Class C3) at No. 239.\n",
